{
  "id": "RAW_0cafb85155",
  "title": "GPT-6 Astra 直接改千问权重，数学成绩变成 6 倍",
  "url": "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5ODkzMzMwMQ==&mid=2650456351&idx=1&sn=c5d24d5bf8de0bb26b0e0cfcb2e18348",
  "date": "2026-11-04 09:05:00",
  "author": "AINLP",
  "siteName": "AINLP",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>NLPer</span> <span>2026-11-04 09:05</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">江苏</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261104090904_553e668.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>权重空间编程来了</p>\n  <div data-tool=\"mdnice编辑器\" data-website=\"https://www.mdnice.com\" data-renderer-version=\"ainlp-signature-v16\" data-render-profile=\"ainlp_signature_v16\" style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 12px 6px;background:#fcfbf8;width:auto;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#3d3e3b;line-height:1.82;letter-spacing:0;word-break:break-word;overflow-wrap:break-word;text-align:justify;\">\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">MIT CSAIL 团队最近让 GPT-6 Astra 做了一件挺大胆的事：直接打开千问 Qwen3.5-0.8B 的权重，找问题，再动手改。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.1563025210084035\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"595\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"502972687\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261104090904_48b14f9.png\"></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">不用梯度下降，也不允许写训练循环。最后，Astra 改了约&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-weight:700;color:#202428;\"><span leaf=\"\">0.016% 的权重</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，把这个小模型在 MATH-500 上的成绩从&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-weight:700;color:#202428;\"><span leaf=\"\">7.9% 拉到 48.1%</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">，变成原来的 6.1 倍。指令遵循测试 IFEval 也从 21.0% 涨到了 62.3%。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这项由 Rikiya Takehi、Jayden Teoh、Alex Zhang 和 Omar Khattab 在 11 月 2 日公开的研究，叫&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-weight:700;color:#202428;\"><span leaf=\"\">Weight-Space Programming，权重空间编程</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">。读出一个神经网络在做什么，修掉它的毛病，甚至从零写出另一个神经网络，都是这次的实验内容。</span></p>\n   <div data-ainlp-figure-role=\"evidence\" style=\"margin:20px 0 22px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;width:100%;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" alt=\"研究原图中的三项任务 读取权重 修复策略 改善千问\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.5925\" data-s=\"300\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:5px;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261104090904_7f7a802.png\"></p>\n    <p style=\"align-self:stretch;margin:7px 8px 0;padding:0;color:#7d7972;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.65;text-align:center;\"><span leaf=\"\">研究中的三项任务 读取权重 修复策略 改善千问</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Takehi 在推文下做了更多的介绍，连同实验日志和改好的模型一起公开：</span></p>\n   <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.1946308724832215\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"596\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/QsOstc0fpvnO3wYRRYMtrJpedD2pFtzWKgjCbSxnjpogggbAjTnKMz6qVEibtOyYLDHXs4w6OYO1OPzo6LhBYseO9jmq2G8rT002VACdlQ2c/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"554\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"708\" data-imgfileid=\"502972688\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261104090904_711d890.png\"></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:30px 8px 17px;padding:22px 0 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(126,116,104,.22);\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',STSong,Georgia,serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#1f6f68;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">先让千问把题做完</span></span></h2>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Astra 接到的任务很简单：让 Qwen3.5-0.8B 更擅长数学。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">研究者给它一个装载了模型权重的 Python 环境，以及 GSM8K 和 MATH 训练集里的练习题。它可以检查权重、分析运行结果、修改参数，再花掉一定数量的前向调用来验证。最终评测集不向它开放。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">50 次前向调用是最高一档预算，一次可以批量处理题目，并不是只准试 50 道题。优化器和反向传播被拿掉了，观察与测试还在。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">很快，Astra 碰到了这个小模型的老毛病：</span><strong style=\"font-weight:700;color:#202428;\"><span leaf=\"\">想得停不下来。</span></strong></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">最初检查的 96 份练习题回答里，有 85 份一路写到了 32,768 token 的上限。重复同一段推理，绕回已经走过的步骤，最后留不出答案。Qwen 自己的模型卡也提醒过，0.8B 版本更容易陷入这种思考循环。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Astra 顺着运行表现和内部计算查下去，最终定位到编号 15 和 19 的两层 MLP。它从两层各选出 64 个输出列，减掉一个与循环行为相关的方向，一共涉及 131,072 个权重。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">改完，再用相同的采样设置评测：</span></p>\n   <table style=\"margin:18px 8px 22px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#3d3e3b;\">\n    <tbody>\n     <tr>\n      <th style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;background:#eef4f8;font-weight:700;color:#202428;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">测试</span></p>\n      </th>\n      <th style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;background:#eef4f8;font-weight:700;color:#202428;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">原模型</span></p>\n      </th>\n      <th style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;background:#eef4f8;font-weight:700;color:#202428;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">修改后</span></p>\n      </th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">MATH-500</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">7.9</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">48.1</span></p>\n      </td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">GSM8K</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">13.8</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">67.1</span></p>\n      </td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">IFEval</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">21.0</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">62.3</span></p>\n      </td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">触及长度上限</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">93.0</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">33.1</span></p>\n      </td>\n     </tr>\n    </tbody>\n   </table>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">评测开启思考，最多输出 32,768 token。表内均为百分比，最后一项是 MATH-500 回答触及长度上限的比例，越低越好。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">许多原本卡在半路的回答，终于能够交卷了。指令遵循也跟着变好，说明这个循环问题影响的不只是数学题。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">研究者还换了一个不太容易循环的 Gemma 3 270M。Astra 看到了算术错误、错误的代数步骤，却没找到一个删掉就能解决问题的共同部件。50 次调用预算下，MATH-500 只从 6.8% 变成 7.0%，没有明确改善。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这组对照很有意思：找到并修掉一个计算故障，和给模型补上它还不会的数学，是两件难度不同的事。</span></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:30px 8px 17px;padding:22px 0 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(126,116,104,.22);\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',STSong,Georgia,serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#1f6f68;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">权重里可以读出什么</span></span></h2>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这次研究一共做了八组实验。更早的几组，先考 Astra 能不能看懂权重。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">研究者训练了四个小游戏网络，分别玩打砖块、乒乓球、吃豆人和过马路。四个网络的结构、输入和动作设置完全相同，再把 17,253 个权重直接作为数字交给 Astra，问它各自在玩什么游戏。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">没有给候选答案，也不让用工具，它四个都认了出来。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">例如，打砖块网络对底部一排位置有特殊反应，对应球拍所在的位置；输出层又区分了不同移动动作。Astra 从这些数值分布里推断出了游戏。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">另一个实验更直观。一辆由 PPO 策略控制的小车，被斜坡卡住了：只知道向前顶，始终冲不过去。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">研究者把场景、权重和一次失败轨迹交给 Astra。它给出的修法是先倒车，拉开助跑距离，再全速向前。具体做法是在网络里加出一条小的计算路径，读取位置和速度；等车越过障碍，这条路径就关闭，由原策略继续开。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-ratio=\"1.4300341296928327\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"586\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"502972699\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261104090904_621e644.png\"></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这次只改了 3.5% 的权重。原策略在 256 局测试中没有成功，修改后的策略在 1,024 局中全部成功。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">那条“先倒一点，再往前冲”的策略，被直接写进了神经网络。</span></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:30px 8px 17px;padding:22px 0 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(126,116,104,.22);\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',STSong,Georgia,serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#1f6f68;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">连小游戏模型都能直接写</span></span></h2>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">修已有模型还不够，团队又让 Astra 从零写权重。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">给定三个 MinAtar 小游戏的规则、源码和网络结构，所有权重从零开始。Astra 要在一次回复里给出权重，期间不能运行游戏、试错或训练。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">以打砖块为例，它先构思球拍应该怎么动，再把策略翻译进网络：第一层算球会落到哪里，第二层把球拍移过去。</span></p>\n   <p nodeleaf=\"\"></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">作者用相同结构的 PPO 网络做了比较，每个结果评测 1,000 局：</span></p>\n   <table style=\"margin:18px 8px 22px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:#3d3e3b;\">\n    <tbody>\n     <tr>\n      <th style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;background:#eef4f8;font-weight:700;color:#202428;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">游戏</span></p>\n      </th>\n      <th style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;background:#eef4f8;font-weight:700;color:#202428;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">PPO 1 亿步</span></p>\n      </th>\n      <th style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;background:#eef4f8;font-weight:700;color:#202428;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">PPO 5 亿步</span></p>\n      </th>\n      <th style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;background:#eef4f8;font-weight:700;color:#202428;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">Astra</span></p>\n      </th>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">Breakout</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">15.8</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">25.3</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">517.4</span></p>\n      </td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">Seaquest</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">5.6</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">88.9</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">53.1</span></p>\n      </td>\n     </tr>\n     <tr>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">Asterix</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">25.8</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">55.2</span></p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"padding:9px;border:1px solid #dce5ec;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;\">\n       <p><span leaf=\"\">53.2</span></p>\n      </td>\n     </tr>\n    </tbody>\n   </table>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">Astra 写出的网络超过了三项游戏里训练 1 亿步的 PPO 对照。把 PPO 预算加到 5 亿步后，打砖块仍明显领先，另外两项则是 PPO 更高。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这里的吸引力也不只在跑分。过去让 AI 做这件事，常见路线是写训练代码、调超参数、启动训练。现在，它开始把一个具体玩法直接编进权重。</span></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:30px 8px 17px;padding:22px 0 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(126,116,104,.22);\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',STSong,Georgia,serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#1f6f68;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">模型开始成为可编辑的对象</span></span></h2>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">读权重也有读不懂的时候。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">团队给了 Astra 两个经过不同微调的 Gemma 小模型，一个正常回答，一个迎合用户。只看权重，Astra 四次尝试都没能判断哪个更爱迎合；允许查看它们在给定文本上的注意力分布后，才分辨出来。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">权重、激活、运行轨迹和测试反馈，仍然要一起用。千问实验也是如此：Astra 可以检查和测试模型，再决定怎样改。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">但操作对象确实变了。它不再只修改模型外围的提示词和 harness，而是开始碰到模型内部的计算。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:0 8px 17px;\"><span leaf=\"\">这也是研究者把 RSI 列为后续方向的原因：如果模型能够检查、调试和改进权重，自我改进就有了更直接的操作空间。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.4383561643835616\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"584\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/QsOstc0fpvnYlpHia9ttWIjoWjoZJeYiaGkyNJBDVJY0n3FodEXsmMdriaWSEz1oqMYzIgY5YWgAhHbeUSdMNC00l1t23iaVpr4CfxJhTyyMju8/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"554\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"798\" data-imgfileid=\"502972702\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261104090904_6d3b851.png\"></p>\n   <h2 style=\"margin:30px 8px 17px;padding:22px 0 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(126,116,104,.22);\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',STSong,Georgia,serif;font-size:22px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:700;color:#1f6f68;text-align:left;\"><span leaf=\"\">参考链接</span></span></h2>\n   <ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;margin:0 8px 24px;padding:0 0 0 22px;color:#1e6bb8;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">\n     <p style=\"margin:5px 0;color:#66727d;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\">MIT CSAIL 研究原文：<a href=\"https://rikiyat.github.io/blog/weight-space-programming/\" target=\"_blank\">https://rikiyat.github.io/blog/weight-space-programming/</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">\n     <p style=\"margin:5px 0;color:#66727d;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\">研究者相关推文：<a href=\"https://x.com/rikiyatakehi/status/2117313742891327994\" target=\"_blank\">https://x.com/rikiyatakehi/status/2117313742891327994</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">\n     <p style=\"margin:5px 0;color:#66727d;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\">完整实验日志与修改代码：<a href=\"https://github.com/RikiyaT/lm_understand-logs\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/RikiyaT/lm_understand-logs</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">\n     <p style=\"margin:5px 0;color:#66727d;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\">修改后的模型与复跑结果：<a href=\"https://huggingface.co/RikiyaT/Qwen3.5-0.8B-weight-space-programming\" target=\"_blank\">https://huggingface.co/RikiyaT/Qwen3.5-0.8B-weight-space-programming</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\">\n     <p style=\"margin:5px 0;color:#66727d;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;word-break:break-all;\"><span leaf=\"\">在线演示：<a href=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/akhaliq/weight-space-programming-demo\" target=\"_blank\">https://huggingface.co/spaces/akhaliq/weight-space-programming-demo</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ul>\n   <div data-ainlp-template=\"footer\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-family:'PingFang SC',system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei UI','Microsoft YaHei',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24272b;letter-spacing:0;\">\n    <p data-ainlp-template=\"footer-profile\" class=\"mp_profile_iframe_wrp\" style=\"margin:0;padding:0;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><mp-common-profile class=\"js_uneditable custom_select_card mp_profile_iframe\" data-pluginname=\"mpprofile\" data-nickname=\"AINLP\" data-alias=\"nlpjob\" data-from=\"0\" data-id=\"MjM5ODkzMzMwMQ==\"></mp-common-profile></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "MIT CSAIL 团队提出 Weight-Space Programming 方法，让 GPT-6 Astra 直接修改千问 Qwen3.5-0.8B 权重，仅改 0.016% 的参数，使 MATH-500 成绩从 7.9% 提升至 48.1%，实现 6.1 倍提升。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "MIT CSAIL 团队提出 Weight-Space Programming 方法，让 GPT-6 Astra 直接修改千问 Qwen3.5-0.8B 权重，仅改 0.016% 的参数，使 MATH-500 成绩从 7.9% 提升至 48.1%，实现 6.1 倍提升。",
  "summary": "MIT CSAIL 团队提出 Weight-Space Programming（权重空间编程）方法，首次展示了如何让大模型直接读取、分析并修改其他模型的权重。研究中，GPT-6 Astra 被赋予 Python 环境和模型权重，任务是提升千问 Qwen3.5-0.8B 在 MATH-500 上的数学能力。Astra 通过分析模型在 GSM8K 和 MATH 训练集上的运行表现，发现其思考循环问题，最终定位到两层 MLP 中的特定权重方向，仅修改约 0.016% 的参数（涉及 131，072 个权重），将 MATH-500 得分从 7.9% 提升至 48.1%，GSM8K 从 13.8% 提升至 67.1%，IFEVer 从 21.0% 提升至 62.3%。研究还包括八组实验，展示了 Astra 能否读懂权重、修复策略以及从零编写权重，甚至能为小游戏模型编写策略。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "Weight-Space Programming 方法突破传统微调范式",
      "explanation": "该方法让大模型直接读取权重、分析运行结果、修改参数，无需梯度下降或训练循环，仅通过有限的前向调用（最高 50 次）即可显著提升小模型性能，展示了模型对模型内部机制的理解能力。"
    },
    {
      "point": "极小权重改动实现惊人性能提升",
      "explanation": "仅修改 0.016% 的权重（131，072 个参数），即可将 Qwen3.5-0.8B 在 MATH-500 上的得分提升 6 倍，从 7.9% 提升至 48.1%，证明了针对性修复模型缺陷的高效性。"
    },
    {
      "point": "模型思考循环问题被精准定位与修复",
      "explanation": "Astra 发现千问在 85 份练习题中都触及 32，768 token 上限，定位到编号 15 和 19 两层 MLP 中的循环方向，通过删减特定输出列成功中断循环，提升了数学解题和指令遵循能力。"
    },
    {
      "point": "从零编写权重实现游戏策略超越长期训练",
      "explanation": "在 MinAtar 小游戏测试中，Astra 能在一次回复中给出完整权重，以 Breakout 为例，其跑分 517.4 超过 PPO 训练 1 亿步（15.8）和 5 亿步（25.3）的对照，展示了直接编码策略的潜力。"
    },
    {
      "point": "方法对不同模型和任务具有局限性",
      "explanation": "对 Gemma 3 270M 测试中，Astra 虽能识别算术错误，但未能找到可删除的共同部件，MATH-500 仅从 6.8% 提升至 7.0%，说明某些故障的修复难度与模型能力和问题性质相关。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "不用梯度下降，也不允许写训练循环。最后，Astra 改了约 0.016% 的权重，把这个小模型在 MATH-500 上的成绩从 7.9% 拉到 48.1%，变成原来的 6.1 倍。",
    "权重空间编程（Weight-Space Programming）是一种让大模型直接读取、分析并修改其他模型权重的方法。",
    "Astra 能从零写出权重，以 Breakout 为例，其跑分 517.4 超过 PPO 训练 1 亿步（15.8）和 5 亿步（25.3）的对照。",
    "权重、激活、运行轨迹和测试反馈，仍然要一起用。"
  ],
